{"content": "- After reviewing Law No. 37 of 2014 establishing the COMMUNICATION & INFORMATION TECHNOLOGY REGULATORY AUTHORITY, as amended by Law No. 98 of 2015.\n- Decree No. 312 of 2018 forming the Board of Directors of the COMMUNICATION & INFORMATION TECHNOLOGY REGULATORY AUTHORITY.\n- Cabinet Resolution No. 993 of 2015 issued on 7/13/2015 issuing the executive regulations of the above stated Law No. 37 of 2014.\n- Decree No. 312 of 2018 renewing the formation of the Board of Directors of the COMMUNICATION & INFORMATION TECHNOLOGY REGULATORY AUTHORITY.\n- The approval of the Board of the COMMUNICATION & INFORMATION TECHNOLOGY REGULATORY AUTHORITY at its meeting 4/2021 No. (4/2021) dated 3/28/2021,\n- Based on what is required by the work interest,", "node_id": "9dcc76afa2d092375db2936e1baad9fe", "article_ref": "Chairman of the Board:-", "section_title": "Chairman of the Board:-", "hierarchy_path": "Resolution-No-42-On-Data-Privacy-Protection-Regulation > Chairman of the Board:-", "chunk_id": "Chairman_of_the_Board_d132bf_s0_1", "section_level": "article", "chunk_index": 0, "chunk_total": 4, "parent_chunk_id": "", "embed_skip": false, "is_obligation": true, "chunk_type": "preamble", "jurisdiction": "Kuwait", "regulation_name": "Resolution-No-42-On-Data-Privacy-Protection-Regulation", "doc_title": "Resolution-No-42-On-Data-Privacy-Protection-Regulation", "doc_type": "Law", "issuing_authority": "", "effective_date": "", "publication_date": "", "last_updated": "", "language": "English", "scope_summary": "", "source_url": "", "tokens": 196}
